// Test: Field IDs with parentheses in diagnostics
// Verifies parentheses are sanitized: BT-00(a)-Text -> BT-00_a_-Text
// Original ID preserved in 'see' attribute, sanitized in diagnostic ID

---- STAGE 1a ----

WITH ND-Root
    ASSERT BT-00(a)-Text is present
    AS ERROR R-K7P-M2Q
    FOR BT-00(a)-Text IN 1, 2
